Amendment by Pub. L. 109–59 effective July 1, 2008, but inapplicable to taxes imposed for periods before such date, see section 11125(c) of Pub. L. 109–59, set out as a note under section 5002 of this title.""";
    content_hash "sha256:fd87fad9e2b6f1a4ea699c99d350063ab3de916d506e772a5c2a0b1fcdaa9bbd";
}

// 26 U.S.C. 5123(a) — Preservation and inspection of records, and entry of premises for inspection
fragment IRC_S5123_A in IRC_2024_EDITION {
    kind subsection;
    locator "section/5123/a";
    text en official """(a) Preservation and inspection of records
Any records or other documents required to be kept under this part or regulations issued pursuant thereto shall be preserved by the person required to keep such records or documents, as the Secretary may by regulations prescribe, and shall be kept available for inspection by any internal revenue officer during business hours.""";
    content_hash "sha256:fe3b705f4c1a5bb4710bc4cc93138f7e6ed9520b74d10ef99c41a2838bc4e963";
}

// 26 U.S.C. 5123(b) — Preservation and inspection of records, and entry of premises for inspection
fragment IRC_S5123_B in IRC_2024_EDITION {
    kind subsection;
    locator "section/5123/b";
    text en official """(b) Entry of premises for inspection
The Secretary may enter during business hours the premises (including places of storage) of any dealer for the purpose of inspecting or examining any records or other documents required to be kept by such dealer under this chapter or regulations issued pursuant thereto and any distilled spirits, wines, or beer kept or stored by such dealer on such premises.""";
    content_hash "sha256:9b14e3b4d4d9ca7ec75d6a45c4df1a9181ee63719eb463d2504aeab6b6ee9dac";
}

// 26 U.S.C. §5124 — Registration by dealers
fragment IRC_S5124 in IRC_2024_EDITION {
    kind section;
    locator "section/5124";
    text en official """Registration by dealers
Every dealer who is subject to the recordkeeping requirements under section 5121 or 5122 shall register with the Secretary such dealer's name or style, place of residence, trade or business, and the place where such trade or business is to be carried on. In the case of a firm or company, the names of the several persons constituting the same, and the places of residence, shall be so registered.""";
    content_hash "sha256:7f9b31e7b05d245731349df8f15a3e2469eff9fda5252499388f0f0ff786836a";
}

// 26 U.S.C. §5124 — statutory note 4 (effectivedate-note)
fragment IRC_S5124_NOTE_4 in IRC_2024_EDITION {
    kind note;
    locator "section/5124/note/4";
    text en official """Effective Date
Section effective July 1, 2008, but inapplicable to taxes imposed for periods before such date, see section 11125(c) of Pub. L. 109–59, set out as an Effective Date of 2005 Amendment note under section 5002 of this title.""";
    content_hash "sha256:51ab49ae23f36204e15b1e026559800fc66dff091ee3423c33083bcdde34bb94";
}

