    locator "section/5411/note/6";
    text en official """Effective Date
Section effective July 1, 1959, see section 210(a)(1) of Pub. L. 85–859, set out as a note under section 5001 of this title.""";
    content_hash "sha256:067b07ab29c00dffc3b5c588d79e35a7bfff83f1bf6069c42e153bf8db5d4ef0";
